  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1214.01 Applicability Criteria for Flat Wood Paneling Coatings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1214.01 Applicability Criteria for Flat Wood Paneling Coatings. A source whose flat wood paneling coatings operation, has combined actual emissions, before controls, during any consecutive 12-month period of 3 tons of VOCs or more shall be subject to this part.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1200.html"
